<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Project Report - Wakeup Make Up</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <h1 style="color: #2c3e50; text-align: center;">Wakeup Make Up - Project Status Report</h1>
    <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Date:</strong> June 6, 2026</p>

    <h2 style="color: #34495e; border-bottom: 1px solid #bdc3c7; padding-bottom: 5px;">1. System Overview</h2>
    <p>The "Wakeup Make Up" platform is a comprehensive multi-vendor e-commerce and service booking ecosystem built on a modern, scalable backend technology stack (NestJS, MongoDB). It caters to a diverse range of stakeholders including End Users, Product Vendors, Influencers, Distributors, Service Providers, and Administrators.</p>

    <h2 style="color: #34495e; border-bottom: 1px solid #bdc3c7; padding-bottom: 5px;">2. Currently Implemented Features</h2>
    
    <h3 style="color: #2980b9;">2.1 Authentication & User Management</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Role-based Access Control (RBAC):</strong> Granular access roles including Admin, User, Vendor, Influencer, Distributor, and Service Provider.</li>
        <li><strong>Secure Authentication:</strong> JWT (JSON Web Token) and Passport-based secure login mechanisms.</li>
        <li><strong>Profile Management:</strong> Comprehensive profile creation and management for all user types.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="color: #2980b9;">2.2 Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Advanced Product Catalog:</strong> Vendors can create, update, and manage products, structured categories, SEO meta-data, and complex product variants (e.g., sizes, colors, brands).</li>
        <li><strong>Shopping Experience:</strong> End-users can browse products, manage their Cart, and curate a Wishlist.</li>
        <li><strong>Order & Checkout Flow:</strong> Complete order placement capability.</li>
        <li><strong>Discounts & Promotions:</strong> Integrated Coupon management system for discounting and promotions.</li>
        <li><strong>Shipping & Logistics:</strong> Deep integration with Shiprocket for order shipping, tracking, and delivery management.</li>
        <li><strong>User Reviews:</strong> Users can submit reviews and ratings for products to establish trust.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="color: #2980b9;">2.3 Service Marketplace (Salon/Makeup Services)</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Provider Onboarding:</strong> Service providers can register, submit verification documents, and undergo an Admin approval process.</li>
        <li><strong>Subscription Plans:</strong> Admins can create and manage tier-based subscription plans for service providers.</li>
        <li><strong>Service Management:</strong> Providers can list their specific services, add staff members, and configure staff availability and time slots.</li>
        <li><strong>Booking System:</strong> Users can discover services, view real-time available slots, and book appointments.</li>
        <li><strong>Lead Generation:</strong> The system automatically captures and manages user leads for different service categories.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="color: #2980b9;">2.4 Financials & Wallet System</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Digital Wallets:</strong> Dedicated digital wallet ledgers for Users, Vendors, Influencers, and Service Providers.</li>
        <li><strong>Cashback System:</strong> Support for dynamic cashback slabs and automated cashback distribution rules.</li>
        <li><strong>Payout Management:</strong> Vendors and Service Providers can request payouts from their wallet balance. Admins have a dedicated interface to review and securely process these payouts.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="color: #2980b9;">2.5 Dashboard & Analytics</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Comprehensive Dashboards:</strong> Dedicated views to track statistical reports and key performance metrics (sales, service bookings, user growth).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color: #34495e; border-bottom: 1px solid #bdc3c7; padding-bottom: 5px;">3. Technical Capabilities & Infrastructure</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Backend Architecture:</strong> Modular and scalable architecture using the NestJS framework (TypeScript).</li>
        <li><strong>Database:</strong> MongoDB for flexible, high-performance data storage, modeled using Mongoose.</li>
        <li><strong>Media Storage:</strong> Cloudinary integration for scalable, optimized image and asset hosting.</li>
        <li><strong>Email Communications:</strong> Nodemailer integration for reliable transactional emails (e.g., OTPs, order confirmations).</li>
        <li><strong>Logging & Auditing:</strong> Winston integration with daily log file rotation for reliable audit trails, debugging, and system monitoring.</li>
    </ul>
</body>
</html>
